Plugging the given values:
L = 2.21 x 10^-19 J N N^-1 * (1/0.231 nm)^2
L = 2.21 x 10^-19 G N N^-1 * (1.437 x 10^2 N N^-1)
L = 3.12 x 10^2 N

So, the latent energy of KCl is approximately 3.12 x 10^2 J.
